{
  "duration": 78.919,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.399,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.939,
      "end": 3.259,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.799,
      "end": 6.659,
      "text": "Now, in this problem, we are given that the speed of a delivery van,"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.219,
      "end": 8.159,
      "text": "excluding stops,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.659,
      "end": 10.439,
      "text": "is forty-five kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.099,
      "end": 14.679,
      "text": "Its average speed, including stops, is thirty-six kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.479,
      "end": 17.879,
      "text": "Also, the total journey time, including stops,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.359,
      "end": 19.239,
      "text": "is five hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.719,
      "end": 23.379,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the total stoppage time. Now, first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.719,
      "end": 25.42,
      "text": "let us find the total distance covered."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.899,
      "end": 27.92,
      "text": "Since the average speed, including stops,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.439,
      "end": 30.279,
      "text": "is thirty-six kilometer per hour,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.879,
      "end": 34.459,
      "text": "the total distance is equal to average speed into total time."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 36.919,
      "text": "That is equal to thirty-six into five."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.36,
      "end": 39.299,
      "text": "This gives us one hundred and eighty kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.84,
      "end": 41.459,
      "text": "Now that we know the total distance,"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.979,
      "end": 43.959,
      "text": "let us find the actual moving time."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.579,
      "end": 50.279,
      "text": "Moving time is equal to total distance divided by the speed at which the van was moving without any stoppage."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.759,
      "end": 53.18,
      "text": "That is equal to one hundred and eighty divided by forty-five."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.68,
      "end": 54.879,
      "text": "This gives us four hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.279,
      "end": 57.039,
      "text": "Now we have both the values we need."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.5,
      "end": 61.719,
      "text": "The total journey took five hours, but the van was moving only for four hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.119,
      "end": 68.219,
      "text": "So the stoppage time is equal to total time minus moving time, which is five minus four. This gives us one hour,"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.599,
      "end": 71.22,
      "text": "and one hour is equal to sixty minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.799,
      "end": 74.919,
      "text": "So the total stoppage time is sixty minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.559,
      "end": 78.919,
      "text": "Hence, the correct answer is option B."
    }
  ],
